WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.759
Open your WhatsApp account, select Flows, then Create Flow

00:00:05.759 --> 00:00:11.312
Name it and choose Appointment booking

00:00:11.312 --> 00:00:13.808
Copy the booking design from this page, then click Paste JSON

00:00:13.808 --> 00:00:17.407
Both screens arrive. Parts that read live data stay as JSON

00:00:17.407 --> 00:00:22.617
Click Save draft, then Cancel to see its details

00:00:22.617 --> 00:00:24.807
Under Data source, click Set up data source

00:00:24.807 --> 00:00:28.544
Keep Calendar and pick your connected calendar

00:00:28.544 --> 00:00:33.382
The date and slots screens are already picked. Check the timezone

00:00:33.382 --> 00:00:36.757
Click Save

00:00:36.757 --> 00:00:38.360
The Flow now reads free slots from the calendar

00:00:38.360 --> 00:00:45.037
Click Publish, then Publish again to confirm

00:00:45.037 --> 00:00:48.744
Live data shows Calendar, via Ringg
